Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史上的疑案 请欢迎主持人葛彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mysteries in History, with your host, Peter Graves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:33.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有人能证明他们的存在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although no one has ever been able to prove their existence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:37.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,神秘的政府单位 星际战警组织...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}a quasi-government agency, the Men in Black{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:40.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直在地球上从事秘密行动...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}supposedly carries out operationshere on Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:44.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保护地球人不受外星人侵略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to keep us safe from aliens throughout the galaxies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:48.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一起"没发生过"的事件...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is one of their stories that "never happened"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:52.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来自一个"不存在"的档案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}from one of their files that doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1978年 萨塔星领袖纷纷出走...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1978. The leaders of Zartha flee their planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:03.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了逃离卡洛琳星邪恶女王塞琳娜的魔掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to escape the clutches of the evil kylothian, Serleena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把最珍贵的宝物带到地球...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arriving on Earth, the Zarthans bring with them their greatest treasure:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:11.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨塔之光 这种威力强大的宇宙力量...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Light of Zartha, a cosmic force so powerful..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:16.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若被敌人夺走将毁灭萨塔星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}that in the wrong hands it could lead to the annihilation of Zartha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨塔公主劳拉恳求星际战警...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Zarthans' princess, Lauranna, beseeched the Men in Black{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:23.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将萨塔之光藏起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}to hide the Light from Serleena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.53,0:01:25.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们恕难从命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:29.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,插手此事将导致地球灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intervention would have meant the destruction of the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:35.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是英勇的星际战警却制伏难缠的塞琳娜...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, in an act of galactic bravery, the Men in Black subdued Serleena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:38.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让萨塔人顺利脱逃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}allowing the Zarthans to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:41.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将萨塔之光藏到别处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they might hide the Light on another planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.98,0:01:47.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞琳娜誓言要夺回萨塔之光...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serleena, released from her captors, vowed that the Light would be hers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:52.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并毁灭胆敢阻止她的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that she would destroy any planet that stood in her way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:56.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这事件被历史淹没...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, never knowing what happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:02:02.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,神秘的星际战警再一次拯救地球...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}the people of Earth were saved by a secret society of protectors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是黑超特警组{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}known as the Men in Black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:47.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑衣人2》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:39.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(2002年7月)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:49.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我过来! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvey, get over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvey. Heel, heel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:55.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别对着月亮乱叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're barking at the moon, moron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pretty lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的味道真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taste good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:08.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:15.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的味道也不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别耍帅逞英雄 乖乖守规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing fancy, no heroics. By the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:08.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道啦! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:12.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫 怎么了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, jeff. What's happening, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你跑来这儿干嘛? - 老大在跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were wondering why you're here. - The man's talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:20.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们都说好了 你只要留在E F跟R线地铁隧道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know our arrangements. Stay in the E, F and R subway lines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:23.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想吃多少垃圾都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you get all the garbage you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:26.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跑来干嘛 小虫虫? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing here, worm boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jeff...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:39.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,饶了他吧 他是个菜鸟...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse my partner. He's new and he's kind of stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:48.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你变胖了 你吃了什么呀? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You getting big, jeff. Boy, what you been eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想玩玩 是吧? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like jokes, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jeffrey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,睡个好觉吧 大家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams, big boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做个好梦吧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是地铁局工作人员 请大家走到前列车厢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transit authority. Move to the forward car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电路系统有异物入侵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a bug in the electrical system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们这些人! 有异物入侵啦! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}People! We got a bug in the electrical system!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道要逃了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now y'all running?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别走 坐呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:15.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是条六百英尺的大虫嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a 600-foot worm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:22.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们都给我滚出去 - 我要你全速前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everybody out. - Put the hammer down on this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:26.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里我才是老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Captain Larry Bridgewater. I decide what happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是老大? 好吧 给我过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You decide? Okay, come here. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老大? 看这是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry? That's my man, jeff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:39.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我了解了 - 你快给我滚进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Larry just made a decision. - Larry need to take his ass in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:49.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我开枪! 杰夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me do this, jeff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:16.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,81街站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighty-first Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:21.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}just a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家请注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have your attention, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约市感谢各位参加这次演习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thank youfor participating in our drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是真的 你们都会被吃掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had this been an emergency, you'd have been eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:35.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不肯听话 愚蠢无知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you don't listen. You're ignorant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:39.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我都一头撞进车厢了 这就是你们纽约人的毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How a man gonna bash through! That's the problem with New Yorkers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,“我们什么怪事都看过了 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We've seen it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大虫虫耶 救我啊 黑人先生!”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} A 600-foot worm! Save us, Mr. Black Man!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很客气请你们到前列车厢你们却无动于衷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask you nice, "Move to the next car." You just sit there like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢各位参加这次演习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for participating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:55.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是全新的小型省电地铁列车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully, you enjoyed our smaller, energy-efficient subway cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:59.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心月台间隙 祝您愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your step. You will have a nice evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:06.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,派清理小组到81街和公园路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a cleanup crew at 81 st and Central Park West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:09.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻撤销杰夫的行动许可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revoke jeff's movement privileges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:12.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,派人把他送回查伯街站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have him escorted to the Chamber Street station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.31,0:11:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最后麻烦哪一位检查下麻醉剂的使用期限{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And please check the expiration date on the unipod worm tranquilizers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 地铁停运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, fellas. Station closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 紧急演习 以策安全 - 什么烂地铁嘛? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emergency drill. For your safety. - Do you believe these putzes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我没守规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I know, by the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:51.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有多久没抬头看星星? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, when was the last time we just looked at the stars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:54.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在考我 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a test. I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在宇宙是孤零零的吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever feel like you're alone in the universe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:10.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我请你吃一块派 - 真的假的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, let me buy you a piece of pie. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:15.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是孤零零的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're not alone in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:18.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把手拿开 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remove the arm. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴 查理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, shut up, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:27.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你老是在我背后说坏话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of you constantly talking behind my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:32.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你泡到一个漂亮美眉你却跟人家说这句蠢话:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You meet a girl. She's into it. The best line you come up with is:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:37.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想玩3P吃蛋沙拉吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna come back to my place for some tonsil hockey and egg salad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:40.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? 你是怎么进来的? - 你爱吃蛋沙拉吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you and how'd you get in here? - You like egg salad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞琳娜! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serleena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早说是你嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you say it was you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:52.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我收到消息 萨塔之光呢? - 事情是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the Light? - Here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到处在找这个什么光 我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking for this Light. We found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:59.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要的话就得付五千万 咱们就这么做...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it, it'll cost you 50 mill. Here's how it'll work. First...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.62,0:13:02.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨塔之光呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the Light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 不过有一个人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't find it, but we found a guy who might know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:15.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在春泉街开一家披萨店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He runs a pizza parlor on Spring Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:20.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 走吧 擦擦鼻子 - 猪头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. And wipe your nose.  - Idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:29.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真好吃 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good pie. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:32.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人真多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crowded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家店很有名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they got good pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:41.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:43.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要消除我的记忆 - 不会啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna neuralyze me. - No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会 你怕我出糗才带我来这儿 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took me here so I wouldn't make a scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:48.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样很糗耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You making a scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:52.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你 你为何加入黑超特警组? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you a question. Why did you join MiB?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是军人 我想尽忠报国 捍卫地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six years in the Marines. I like the action. Protect the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想当英雄? 你来错地方了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like being a hero? You joined the wrong organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:03.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你听过詹姆斯·艾德华吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ever heard of james Edwards? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:07.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他今天在地铁站救了85人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he saved the lives of 85 people on the subway tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人知道他的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one knows he exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:15.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不存在 怎么能当英雄? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if no one knows he exists, how can anyone ever love him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:21.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候开始搭档的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how long we been partners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 二月一号 - 五个月零三天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Feb 1. - Five months, three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 中午开始 - 九小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Started at noon. - Nine hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去结婚 然后生孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get married. Have a bunch of kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:39.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:47.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 他很害羞 不过他对你有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. My buddy's kind of shy, but he thinks you are hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:59.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道大家看了会说什么吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years from now, you know what people'll say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:03.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 员工的员少写一个口? - 这是照笔划算钱的嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Employee" is misspelled? - They charge by the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:07.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"她这大人物在这儿打过工"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll say, "lmagine that. Big shot like her used to work here."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:09.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 班.. - 这是你应得的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ben - You deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:12.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便到地下室搬一箱汽水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up a case of Mountain Dew from the basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:22.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两片香肠口味披萨 还有关于萨塔之光的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two slices of pepperoni and information about the Light of Zartha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:26.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 求求你 别伤害我 - 萨塔之光呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoever you are, don't hurt me. - Where's the Light, Ben?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:29.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么 把我放下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about. Let me down, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:32.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要报案...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I want to report a robbery...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:42.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:45.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,厨房啦! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitchen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个猪头看到什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You idiots see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:55.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后门被风吹开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wind blew the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:57.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么异状{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing out of the ordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:01.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这25年来我寻遍宇宙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For 25 years, l've traveled the universe looking for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是它却还在地球 对吧? 你把它藏在这儿? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it never left Earth, did it? You kept it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:06.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:09.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间了 萨塔之光呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm running out of time. Where's the Light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:12.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我发誓我不知道 - 听好了 萨塔人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know what you mean. - Listen, Zarthan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:14.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把它藏在地球 我会找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hid the Light on Earth. I'll find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:18.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到时候萨塔星就是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we have the Light, Zartha will be ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:21.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来不及了 明天午夜...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late. Tomorrow at midnight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:24.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它就会离开第三行星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Light will leave the third planet and be back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你白跑一趟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry you made the trip for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:40.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,东西到底在不在地球? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we don't know if it's on Earth or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:42.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第三行星就是地球 白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said third planet. It's here, you idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:46.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太阳数过来第三颗行星? - 我到现在才知道耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Third Rock from the Sun. - I never got that till now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:50.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个人知道它的下落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on Earth, and I know who's gonna tell me where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:18.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不回家吗? - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you ever go home? - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:21.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又开除一个搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I see you neuralyzed another partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:30.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们下次用核融碳化枪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, Dee, when you use a fission carbonizer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:34.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记得在枪管上装原子消音器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}attach a de-atomizer so it doesn't sound like a cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:39.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿鞋子吧 你刮花地板了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get some booties on them things. You're crapping up the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:43.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,检查这傢伙的护照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check his visa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:48.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼人在伪造星际护照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cephalopods have been making counterfeits at Kinko's on Canal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:53.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿怎么会有一只死异形? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why do I have a dead Tricrainasloph going through passport control?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:57.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的错 对不起 请你别消除我的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be my fault. I'm very sorry. Please don't neuralyze me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:18:01.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是什么意思? - 没什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell's that supposed to mean? - Nothing, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:06.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在地铁站干得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work in the subway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:10.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我记得杰夫以前才这么大 - 还有什么任务? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I remember jeff when he was yea high. - What you got for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到下面那些穿黑西装的吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. See those guys in black suits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们也是星际战警 放轻松点 - Z 拜托 有什么任务? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They work here. We got it covered. - Zed, what you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:20.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽忠职守是一回事 不过千万别为工作鞠躬尽瘁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dedication's one thing, but this job will eat you up and spit you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:24.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想五十岁时也像我这样吗? ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to look like me when you hit 50?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五十几了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去健身房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be in the gym if you need me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,春泉街发生一起凶杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, there was a killing earlier. 177 Spring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:35.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死者凶手都是外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien-on-alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:37.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你带T一起去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Tee with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他哦 他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,护照加签 不是急件 怎么样? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Passport, no rush, what about jay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:49.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能一直开除黑超特警组员工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have got to stop neuralyzing MiB personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:52.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那老兄在餐馆哭哭啼啼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was cryingin the middle of the diner.{\r}
