Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:42.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我已经送回总部进行分析 - 他的身体脂肪是零耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We sent samples to Em for analysis. - Hey, 0% body fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:46.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好笑 - 目击证人? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Funny. - Witness?{\r}
