Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:58.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这最好让我来处理 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll handle this one. - You got it.{\r}
