Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.91,0:21:13.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你深呼吸 一切都很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a deep breath. Everything is all right.{\r}
