Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:38.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在案发前吃了什么? - 披萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was the last thing you ate? - Calzone.{\r}
