Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:42.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 菠菜口味? - 蘑菇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spinach? - Mushroom.{\r}
