Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.46,0:25:18.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,证人说嫌犯在找什么光...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The perps were looking for the Light of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:19.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 萨塔之光 - 对 那是什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zartha. - Yeah, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.13,0:25:22.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没道理 那不在地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This makes no sense. It's not on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.76,0:25:26.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们早就搞定了 - 很显然你们没搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We took care of this a long time ago. - Obviously not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:28.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是坏消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is very bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.40,0:25:32.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,25年前萨塔人来到地球 想把萨塔之光藏起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Zarthans came to Earth to hide the Light from Serleena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.27,0:25:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们不能这么做 - 没错 我命令他们把它带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't do that. - Right. I ordered it off the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.94,0:25:37.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 Z...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Zed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.75,0:25:40.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,中央公园有一艘卡洛琳太空船 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a Kylothian class C in my park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.04,0:25:42.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定萨塔之光不在这儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} Are you sure this Light isn't here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.35,0:25:45.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,确定 我派最顶尖的探员处理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positive. I gave the order. My best agent carried it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.15,0:25:48.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跟我交给你一样放心 - 那就去问他呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's as if I gave it to you. - Ask the agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.89,0:25:49.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 办不到 - 他挂了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't. - Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:53.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多 他在邮局上班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of. He works at the post office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.46,0:25:55.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:58.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是K先被塞琳娜找到就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Serleena gets to kay before we do, he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.60,0:26:01.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地球的命运握在他手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Earth's very existence may rest on what Kay knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你消除了他的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad you wiped out his memory of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.44,0:26:05.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.31,0:26:07.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:11.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酷毙了 我们去找K探员 传奇人物 办案高手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How cool is this? Going to get Kay. The legend, the go-to guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.71,0:26:14.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把一身本领传授给你的师父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy who taught you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:19.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 黑超特警组史上最伟大的探员 - 弗兰克! 别再说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The greatest agent in MiB history! - Frank! Stop talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.89,0:26:24.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖坐着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:26.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我虽看起来像小狗 但那只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, partner. I may look like a dog{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.09,0:26:29.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在地球的掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I only play one here on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.93,0:26:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 随便啦 擦擦口水 - 喂 辣妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatever. Wipe your mouth. - Hey, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.77,0:26:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位特鲁罗镇民请大家注意听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}People of Truro, may I kindly have your attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.24,0:26:44.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了加速邮件处理...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To facilitate your shipping needs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.85,0:26:47.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一件包裹都要正确包装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All packages must be properly wrapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.68,0:26:51.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一个就是错误的示范{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one is an example of "go home and do it again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.75,0:26:54.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维吉辛太太 我想就是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know what I mean, Mrs. Vigushin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.72,0:26:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,牛皮纸和麻绳是标准包法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brown paper and triple-twist twine are the preferred media.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.73,0:27:01.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.83,0:27:05.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- K - 这是C窗口 快递和空运邮件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kay. - C. Express mail, two-day air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.34,0:27:13.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯文 真好笑 你不太像凯文...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin. That's funny. You don't have a "Kevin".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.28,0:27:18.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得我 我们一起工作过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember. We worked together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.68,0:27:22.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没在殡仪馆上过班 帅哥 有什么我能效劳吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l never worked in a funeral home. Something I can do for you, slick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.95,0:27:24.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就直说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight to the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.35,0:27:29.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾是秘密机构成员 负责监控住在地球上的外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were an agent of an organization that monitors aliens on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是星际战警 现在出了状况 我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the Men in Black. We have a situation. We need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面有一家免费的精神病院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a free mental health clinic on the corner of Lilac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:39.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 下一位 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Next. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.37,0:27:42.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 二十张淘气小兵邮票 - 伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twenty Rugrats stamps. - Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.57,0:27:46.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美国邮政总署没跟得上潮流...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Postal Service hasn't kept up with today's youth, but we have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有二战纪念邮票 歌剧名伶? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berlin airlift stamps. Opera legends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.88,0:27:52.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美属萨摩亚群岛风景? 阿米什人? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}American Samoa? Amish quilts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.01,0:27:55.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小乖乖 我们得拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, got a world to save here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.12,0:27:59.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你当年并没昏迷 那全是幌子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no coma. It was a cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.35,0:28:01.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 问题是 你是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.32,0:28:05.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是麻省特鲁罗镇邮局局长 我命令你离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The postmaster of Truro, Massachusetts, and I'm ordering you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.50,0:28:09.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 无咖啡因吗? - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ls that decaf? - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.13,0:28:12.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 有人非法入侵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a breach. Cordon off this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:15.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,封锁现场 彻底清除现场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full perimeter wipe-down, right here, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.84,0:28:20.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻将闲杂人等赶出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a mop and escort all civilian personnel from this site immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.41,0:28:23.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己听 谁会这么说话? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to yourself, Kay. Who talks like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.57,0:29:22.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你在这里如鱼得水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think you're so comfortable here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.00,0:29:27.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,邮局员工几乎全是外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}just about everybody who works in a post office is an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:37.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不准吸烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No smoking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:51.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我太太到赌城看过魔术师让白老虎飞起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife and I saw Siegfried and Roy fly a tiger around a room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小子 你这套把戏还不够看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothing special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.37,0:29:56.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你抬头看星星 内心深处...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you look at the stars, you get a feeling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.44,0:29:58.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道自己是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you don't know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.61,0:30:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对外星的了解甚于你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you know more about out there than you do down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:07.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你老婆才会离开你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why she left you, Kay. That's why your wife left you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'll tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.05,0:30:14.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道自己的身份就跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know who you really are, take a ride with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.12,0:30:18.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不然你就回去送信吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If not, people are waiting for their TV Guides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.13,0:30:23.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他来不来? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think he'll bite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.54,0:30:33.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就跟你去一趟 事情不对劲我就马上走人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just going for a ride. lf things don't add up, it's hasta luego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:35.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.34,0:30:38.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it hanging?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.93,0:30:54.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 不管你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you too, whoever you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.37,0:31:03.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就跟你去看看吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's see what you got here, chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.01,0:31:16.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎归队 K探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, Agent Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:18.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.49,0:31:21.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 K{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greetings, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.76,0:31:25.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看谁回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, look who's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.23,0:31:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想打扰你 - 天啊 你是K探员! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't mean to bother you - You're Agent Kay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.96,0:31:31.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大家都这么说 - 幸会 我是G探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what they tell me. - This is an honor. Agent Gee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:33.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑超特警组史上最受尊敬的探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most respected agent in MiB history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.93,0:31:36.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全宇宙最有名的人类在我面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most feared human in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.60,0:31:39.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你喝杯咖啡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I could buy you a cup of coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.74,0:31:42.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 黑咖啡 两块方糖 - 我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Black, two sugars, if you're going. - An honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.58,0:31:45.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的要... - 很高兴见到你 K{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I'll take a... My man? - Good to see you, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.61,0:31:49.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.18,0:31:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卓拉人走了 条约也签了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Drolacks are gone and the treaty is signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.85,0:31:52.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.02,0:31:56.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,Z 那你答应我的职位呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about that position you promised me in Men in Black?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.52,0:31:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在替你争取外星人保障名额 有消息就通知你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still working on the alien affirmative action program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.09,0:32:02.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你明明答应的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what you promised me.{\r}
