Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.12,0:38:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没货了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.33,0:38:42.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我有 机器失效你就会轰掉我的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if I did, if it doesn't work, he dies, you blow my head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.40,0:38:46.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是K恢复了记忆 他也会把我的脑袋轰掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it does, l've brought back Kay, who, for fun, blows my head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.60,0:38:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么好处? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's my incentive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.87,0:38:53.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 我放在除雪机旁边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, homey, I keep it downstairs next to the snow blowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.51,0:38:59.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外星囚犯被释放 整装待发 听命行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien prisoners released, armed and ready for your orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.91,0:39:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全宇宙的坏痞子们听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoners of MiB, the scum of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.78,0:39:05.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在轮到坏人当家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's the scum's turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.59,0:39:08.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个麻烦 事情很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in a jam, so I'll make this simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.46,0:39:11.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要萨塔之光 K知道下落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the Light of Zartha, and Kay knows where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.03,0:39:14.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要找到K就能统治地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever brings Kay to me gets Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.53,0:39:17.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先找到记忆恢复器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a deneuralyzer. They want his memory back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.00,0:39:19.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.44,0:39:27.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夏拉 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jarra, good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.38,0:39:33.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该没问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that should do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请仔细听我解释安全措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could have your attention while we go over the safety procedures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.02,0:39:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请勿将头手伸出游乐设施外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your hands inside the vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.72,0:39:43.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你感到头昏脑胀...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If, during the ride, you become disoriented...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.96,0:39:46.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点办法也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's nothing we can do about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.09,0:39:50.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你脱掉首饰珠宝了吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you removed all your jewelry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.13,0:39:54.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会对贝类食物过敏吗? - 快点! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you allergic to shellfish? - jeebs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.70,0:39:57.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, then! Smoke 'em if you got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.04,0:40:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你用过这玩意吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you used this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.68,0:40:09.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我用排气管烤过爆米花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used it to make some hot-air popcorn. That's about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:12.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! Let's make it happen, cap'n!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.74,0:41:09.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"搞定"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.89,0:41:24.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你恢复记忆了 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're back. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.09,0:41:28.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道他的头会长出来? - 它会长出来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you know his head grows back?  - It grows back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.80,0:41:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好 我再也不帮你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real nice. Okay, that's the last time I help out a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.17,0:41:39.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你记起什么吗? - 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kay, you remember anything? - Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.84,0:41:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- K - K 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kay!  - Kay, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.24,0:41:45.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直没有更新软件 我还在用6.0版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got the updated software. Still working off the 6.0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.95,0:41:47.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的大脑要重新开机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brain needs to reboot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.12,0:41:50.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.32,0:41:57.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我诚心诚意地向你道歉 希望这不会影响我们的友情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bottom of my heart, I'm really sorry. I hope it won't affect our friendship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.72,0:42:02.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年来的互相信任和尊敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those years of loyalty and trust, respect for one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.70,0:42:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那儿! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.53,0:42:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- K呢? - 他不在! 他去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Kay? - He's not here! He went...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.20,0:42:13.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K退休了 我是他的接班人 我能效劳吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kay's retired. I'm his trigger-happy replacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.71,0:42:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 正中我的嘴巴 我失去味觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right in the pie hole. Now nothing's gonna taste right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.44,0:42:19.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放下武器 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lower your weapon. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:27.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,J 你好吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jay, how are you, boo-boo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.15,0:42:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们在找K - 他现在是平民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These guys really need Kay. - He's a neutral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:34.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们早就知道了 - 是啊 我们早就...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me something we don't know. - Yeah, tell me something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.79,0:42:36.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I am so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.56,0:42:38.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 保重 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God bless you. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.83,0:42:43.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不把K带回去 塞琳娜会海扁我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't bring Kay back to MiB, Serleena's gonna kick my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.04,0:42:46.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在哪里? - 你说谁呀? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, where is he? - Where is who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.27,0:42:48.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你脸色看起来不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look too good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.58,0:42:51.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸真难看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and you look like crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.25,0:42:57.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不对 他的脸更难看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I take that back. He look like crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.75,0:43:01.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把他折弯 - 把他折弯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bend him! - Bend him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.82,0:43:03.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, don't bend him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.43,0:43:43.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你脚下留情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn decent of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.80,0:43:45.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mention it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.99,0:44:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我快要吐了 - 别这么狠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna be sick. - You don't wanna do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.96,0:44:12.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大伙儿 他说的是实话 - 那他就没用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fellas, I think he's telling the truth. - Then he's no good to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.30,0:44:18.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小子 你还没学会吗? - 三眼怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Didn't I teach you anything, kid? - Pineal eye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.87,0:44:22.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扯他的头须! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for the mosh tendrils!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.64,0:44:29.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 他是吊面人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kay, he's a ball-chinnian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.05,0:44:35.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小鬼 你差点就没命 - 我搞得定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You were in a tight spot. - I handled it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:38.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你需要一个搭档 - 我本来有啊 但他应付不来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need a partner. - I had one. job got too tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.75,0:44:41.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了 你的衣服脏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back. You got some dust on your coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.25,0:44:43.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的记忆恢复了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you got your memory back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.29,0:44:45.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是怎么回事? - 不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is going on? - Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.89,0:44:48.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 萨塔之光是什么? - 从没听过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Light of Zartha? - Never heard of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.53,0:44:49.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.90,0:44:55.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得萨塔之光? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember the Light of Zartha?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.40,0:44:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定消除了这部份的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must've neuralyzed myself to keep it from myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.27,0:45:01.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 棒极了 你在干嘛? - 一向都是我开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good plan. What you doing? - I do the driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.71,0:45:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不对 - 我记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, no. Whoa. - I remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.88,0:45:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前开的是那辆破车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you remember is you used to drive that old, busted jawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.98,0:45:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我开的是全新炫车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I drive the new hotness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:14.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你开破车 我开炫车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old and busted, new hotness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.80,0:45:25.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的炫车完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old busted hotness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.27,0:45:28.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 塞琳娜 求求你 - 好久不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Serleena, please. - Been a long time, Zed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.14,0:45:32.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我 我好感动哦 让我一直弄不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just touched you remembered me. Makes me fuzzy all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.94,0:45:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你漂不漂亮我都不会忘记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never forget a pretty whatever you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.58,0:45:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,Z? 看看你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zed? Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.42,0:45:45.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,25年了 你还是这么帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-five years, and you're still such a looker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.62,0:45:47.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我吃素{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut out the meat and dairy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.52,0:45:51.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你 你还是这么心狠手辣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, still a pile of squirmy crap in a different wrapper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:55.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好猛哦 听着 我们都需要一样东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So feisty. Look, we both need the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.20,0:45:59.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他叫回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.40,0:46:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.67,0:46:03.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了萨塔之光的秘密吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the Light's secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.36,0:46:05.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它午夜不离开地球就会爆炸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's not off Earth by midnight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.81,0:46:09.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摧毁这小小的地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}it self-destructs, annihilating your little planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.41,0:46:13.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我输了你也玩完了 我赢了就一切照旧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lose, you lose. I win, everything keeps spinning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.68,0:46:17.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不想把萨塔之光留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want the Light on Earth any more than I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.29,0:46:21.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 塞琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Serleena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.26,0:46:25.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.69,0:46:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,Z? 是你吗? 我可以当M探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zed? Is that you? I could be Agent Em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.40,0:46:31.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zed. Hello?{\r}
