Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.26,0:57:38.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1978年 五十年来萨塔人陷入苦战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1978. Devastating war of Zartha had raged on for 50 years.{\r}
