Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.37,0:57:44.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们有一个宝物 萨塔之星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Zarthans had a great treasure, the Light of Zartha.{\r}
