Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.74,0:57:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但落入敌手后果就不堪设想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}or complete annihilation, if it fell into the hands of the kylothians.{\r}
