Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.51,1:04:02.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是击退了奎朗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I saved the world from a Kreelon invasion.{\r}
