Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.69,1:04:09.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自己在干嘛吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.32,1:04:12.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我即将跟四条虫和一名邮差...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm about to attack one of the most feared aliens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.46,1:04:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对付全宇宙最凶狠的恶棍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}with four worms and a mailman. Let's make it hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.89,1:04:17.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.93,1:04:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总部被全面封锁! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A code 101 lockdown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.40,1:04:27.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦 整栋大楼都加压 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The building gets pressurized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.57,1:04:29.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进出不得 我当然知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} Nothing in, nothing out. I knew that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.61,1:04:31.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才怪 虫虫 进攻! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you knew. Front and center, worms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.81,1:04:33.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:45.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们早该来了 大美女把里面搞得天翻地覆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time you guys got here. That lady is causing all kinds of hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.58,1:05:08.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要大快朵颐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yummy. Someone I need to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.05,1:05:12.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到发射室 手链会显示出发点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the launch pad. The bracelet shows the departure point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.19,1:05:15.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 无论如何都别回来找我 - 什么意思? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do not come back for me. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.35,1:05:17.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,千万别回来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not come back for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.26,1:05:26.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 虫虫们 开枪掩护我 - 我好怕 不敢动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Worm guys, give me some cover fire. - Too scared, can't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.04,1:05:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.99,1:05:50.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帅哦 - 找到7RD主控板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Limber. - Go to subcontrol panel 7-R-Delta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.06,1:05:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 切断电源 别让他们起飞 - 不行 我好怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut off power so they can't take off. - Can't. Too scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.53,1:06:00.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那儿哦 - 没有子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That way. - Away from the bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.30,1:06:01.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.58,1:06:18.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴又见面了 K{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to see you again, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.79,1:06:24.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 3分钟后发射 - J! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three minutes to launch. - jay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.96,1:06:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,3分钟后发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.66,1:06:29.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,J 好久不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, jay. Long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.29,1:06:31.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夏拉 你的气色真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jarra! What's up, man? You look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.96,1:06:34.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 五年没见了 - 五年又四十二天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's it been? Five years? - And 42 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.77,1:06:37.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蹲苦窖的日子我记得一清二楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You count every one when you're locked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.14,1:06:42.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该偷走臭氧层 我一分钟后就来救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have tried to steal our ozone. Be there in one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.64,1:06:45.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你休想! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over our dead titanium bodies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.41,1:06:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.55,1:06:55.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次可能要久一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's play this one by ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.16,1:07:02.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我早该把你消灭掉 - 你真的很爱劳拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should have vaporized you before. - You really did love Lauranna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.56,1:07:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you, Kay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.73,1:07:06.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个痴心汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You silly little man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.99,1:07:37.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2分钟后发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.00,1:07:40.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快逃吧 我不会有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go, I'll be fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.23,1:07:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别胡说八道 我赢了耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you talking about? I'm winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.90,1:07:47.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么丑还有这么多分身...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarra, you are under arrest for being that ugly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.11,1:07:50.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你关进大牢 快投降吧! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for making that many copies. Surrender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.11,1:07:52.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你碎尸万段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I want him in pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.10,1:08:15.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哇靠 - 他差点没命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rectum. - Damn near killed him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.87,1:08:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,超夸张的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never get tired of that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.80,1:08:20.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 该怎么切断电源呀? - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do we shut off the power? - Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.48,1:08:30.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没事 我马上就来 - 想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine. I'll be there in a minute. - No, he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.52,1:08:38.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩一个了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down to one now, jarra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.20,1:08:50.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,30秒后发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.68,1:09:01.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,15秒后发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen seconds to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.95,1:09:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,10秒后发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.53,1:09:19.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发射中止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch terminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.93,1:09:23.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别小看我 我绝不逃命 - 他抢走你的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you mean, leave you? - Well, he took your gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.57,1:09:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,揍你的脑袋 把你摔得惨兮兮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cracked your head. Slammed you across the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.57,1:09:30.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你被打到满地爬 - 这是苦肉计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Half the time you were on your back. - Look, that's how I fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.34,1:09:33.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've lost, you insignificant speck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.98,1:09:37.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你白白浪费我25年的时间? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've wasted 25 years of my time, and for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.28,1:09:41.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨塔星还是会被摧毁 都是你一时心软{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The total annihilation of Zartha. All because you went mushy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.52,1:09:45.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这软骨头 快投降吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you one last chance to surrender, you slimy invertebrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.89,1:09:49.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能阻止我吗? - 我不能 他能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you gonna do to stop me? - Not me. Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.50,1:09:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的班机被取消了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your flight's been canceled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.51,1:10:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,切断电源 切断电源 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut down power. Shut down power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.38,1:10:04.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好多按钮哦 我用猜的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buttons, buttons. I'm guessing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.11,1:10:06.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.31,1:10:10.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 虫虫! - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Worms! - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.69,1:10:18.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把手链给我 - 我要跟你去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me the bracelet. - I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.49,1:10:21.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家上车 都上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody in the car. Everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.37,1:10:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨塔之光竟然是这条手链? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bracelet is what everybody's been after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.41,1:10:39.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候小东西也很重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's often something small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.31,1:10:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,手链只会显示出发点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the Light. It tells us the departure point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.15,1:10:45.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,11分钟后赶不到那儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't get there in 11 minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.52,1:10:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,手链就会爆炸 摧毁地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}that bracelet will go nuclear and destroy Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.79,1:10:50.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.86,1:10:51.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.86,1:10:54.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 慢着 - 我搞得定啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. - I know what I'm doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.87,1:11:10.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.58,1:11:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这辆车有高速功能! - 系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Modified to hyper-speed! - Seat belts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.18,1:11:20.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.42,1:11:23.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,高速操控器 用来控制方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}At hyper-speed, you have to use the navigational stalk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.06,1:11:33.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用开关切换左右副翼 用摇杆控制升降和速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toggle switches for the ailerons. joysticks for the stabilizer and rudder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.54,1:11:39.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I just want you to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.54,1:11:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下再跟我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on to that for one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.24,1:11:46.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我接总部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, worms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.08,1:11:52.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟她说 臭婊子听好了 你不想被我踢爆屁股的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "Bitch, if you don't want me to kick your skinny Zone Diet ass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.25,1:11:56.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就给我乖乖滚蛋 - 弗兰克 你在哪儿? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- turn around and exit the planet." - Frank, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.32,1:11:57.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥大厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Main hall, egg display.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.92,1:12:00.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遭到攻击 K 快按红钮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking fire. Kay pushed the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.96,1:12:04.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总部 锁定目标 我教你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer at MiB can destroy bogey. I'll walk you through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.10,1:12:11.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,J 弗兰克 你是一只狗的最好搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jay? Frank. You were the best darn partner a Remoolian could ever have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.57,1:12:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.31,1:12:16.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank? Frank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.34,1:12:20.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动自动驾驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here we go, automatic pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.28,1:12:26.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不是自动驾驶 - 高速飞行时不管用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is not automatic piloting. - He doesn't operate at hyper-speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.65,1:12:30.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要的是方向盘! - 只有这玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I could use a steering wheel! - This is what we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.82,1:12:34.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没打过游戏机吗? - 什么游戏机? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Didn't you ever have a Game Boy? - What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.93,1:12:36.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,逊毙了 走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.80,1:12:40.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 那可不是摇杆! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not the navigational stalk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.11,1:12:54.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直接向下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, straight down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.82,1:13:00.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.30,1:13:13.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你进隧道甩不掉她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subway may not be the best place to lose her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.47,1:13:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在哪儿? - 他? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - He?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.34,1:13:18.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫 坐好了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jeff. Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.94,1:13:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.14,1:13:24.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大钢牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.21,1:14:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快来不及了 萨塔之光呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running out of time, Kay. Where is the Light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.41,1:14:03.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.92,1:14:07.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 我就是萨塔之光? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What, I'm the Light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.09,1:14:10.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能 - 你要去救一个星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. No way. - You have a planet to save.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.82,1:14:13.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞错了 我在披萨店打工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mistaken. I work at a pizzeria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.46,1:14:17.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两天前我还是个邮差 你不能否定你的本性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two days ago, I was running a post office. You are who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.60,1:14:20.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是萨塔之光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laura, you are the Light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.87,1:14:24.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨塔人的精神领袖和救星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The leader of your people. Their spirit and their hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.77,1:14:27.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有力量拯救星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power is within you to save a planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.64,1:14:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在保护你 你办得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I protected you until it was your time. Your time is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.41,1:14:40.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要去拯救家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will save a world. You know things before they happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.39,1:14:42.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是天秤座 - 你是萨塔人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm a Libra. - You're Zarthan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.65,1:14:46.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你难过时总会下雨 - 很多人在下雨的时候都会难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When you get sad, it rains. - Lots of people get sad when it rains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.16,1:14:49.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会下雨是因为你难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It rains because you're sad, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.08,1:15:44.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.62,1:15:52.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是人生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.99,1:15:55.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的本性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are who we are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.79,1:15:58.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人不能忘本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if we sometimes forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.71,1:16:10.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫 我没心情骂你! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}jeff, I am so not in the mood for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.44,1:16:12.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我回地铁隧道去! 马上! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back in the subway! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.72,1:16:19.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.89,1:16:23.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.76,1:16:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要立刻上船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot emphasize strongly enough how much we need you on that transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.60,1:16:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,劳拉 你非走不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laura! You have to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.33,1:16:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哎哟 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.74,1:16:41.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会有事 这算小意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. He's fine. He does this all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:43.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.24,1:16:49.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心我扁你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}About to lay the smackdown on your candy ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.55,1:16:51.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,劳拉 这是你的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laura! It's your destiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.12,1:16:54.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在说话耶! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I was talking, Kay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.59,1:16:57.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不准咬人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! No biting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.46,1:17:01.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不走我们都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't go, we all die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.06,1:17:07.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟你妈一样美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just as beautiful as your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.34,1:17:16.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙 K? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kay? A little help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.96,1:17:34.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦用大一点的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might I suggest a bigger gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.05,1:18:02.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小子? - 干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kid? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.12,1:18:06.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你把我带回来 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for bringing me back. - No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.02,1:18:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不早说? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.73,1:18:10.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会让她走吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you have let her go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.28,1:18:36.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当平凡人的感觉如何? 不必每天出生入死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's it like on the outside? Not doing this every day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.35,1:18:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.92,1:18:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,周末睡懒觉 看气象频道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep late on the weekends. Watch the Weather Channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.23,1:18:47.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我很想念大城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l did miss this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.60,1:18:52.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,劳拉是劳拉公主的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Laura is Princess Lauranna's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.04,1:18:57.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们有没有...? - 黑超特警组总部一团糟 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did y'all... - MiB's a mess. Let's go, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.21,1:18:59.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.61,1:19:03.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成千上万人看到这一场好戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousands of people in New York and New jersey saw our little event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.05,1:19:08.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要想出周详的计划 你在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan needs to be thought out. Plan needs to be cool. What you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.09,1:19:15.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还有得学呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, I'll get you trained yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.23,1:19:16.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要那玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I want one of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.93,1:19:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.03,1:19:24.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 - 喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.40,1:19:26.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吧? - 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.00,1:19:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好 大家都碰过这种事 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've all been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.18,1:19:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马子跑了你很伤心 想聊吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl is gone and it hurts. Wanna talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.71,1:19:33.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不想 - 我可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.44,1:19:34.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.61,1:19:35.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在难过吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still sulking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.85,1:19:36.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有啊 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.01,1:19:41.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想念她 谁不会呢? 我泡过一个性感辣妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You miss her. It happens to all of us. I knew this hot young thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.45,1:19:44.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们用各种姿势翻云覆雨...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When our bodies were in the positions of the Kamasutra...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.19,1:19:46.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.92,1:19:48.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别来这套 很恶心耶! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man! Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.19,1:19:50.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子最善变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you about dames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.06,1:19:54.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们要你舔耳朵其实是想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say they want to be scratched, but they really want:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.83,1:19:56.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么 弗兰克! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.67,1:19:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还在难过吗? 需要建议吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Still sitting shiva? Want my advice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.54,1:20:01.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.61,1:20:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不想聊天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.77,1:20:05.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.24,1:20:07.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我好得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fellas, I swear, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.88,1:20:11.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,J万岁! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hail jay! All hail jay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.22,1:20:15.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我从中央车站把他们带来 - 你干嘛放在我的柜子? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I brought them from Grand Central. - Why put them in my locker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.02,1:20:18.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你开心一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it would put things in perspective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.49,1:20:21.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 他们很可怜耶 我们得放他们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of sad. We need to let them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.36,1:20:24.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们知道外面世界很大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to know the world is bigger than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.73,1:20:26.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是搞不清状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still a rookie.{\r}
